        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "i. Affected full-time file clerks wishing to change from a 4 x 10 Schedule or a 5 x 8 scheduling must request such change in writing. No person will be allowed more than one change in each three (3) month period. Changes shall be subject to operational needs.",
