        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "k. Either party may terminate this agreement after thirty (30) days written notice is given to the other party. Upon termination of this agreement, the schedule in effect immediately preceding the implementation of this flexible work schedule shall be reinstated. Unless terminated in accordance with paragraph (j) above, this agreement shall remain in effect.",
